    "capture exact Docker, service, fixture, timeline, and replay-session pre-state",
    "select the retained pit-POV recording in the native VIOS Recorded Streams UI",
    "complete replay WebSocket configuration, SDP, and ICE negotiation in Chromium",
    "observe a live unmuted 1280x720 video track and advancing decoded frames",
    "POST one relative seekForward with a string value and observe further frames",
    "GET the opaque seek position without a client-supplied action query parameter",
    "reject seekSideways with HTTP 501 VMSNotSupportedError and continue playback",
    "invoke the native UI seek-forward control and observe further frames",
    "close the player, observe stream/stop and WebSocket close, and verify the peer is absent",
